// openm2's trees (docs/specs/render.md, "Maps: trees").
//
// A map's tree gets the recipe of the first word its file's name holds and
// the season of the first season word; `default` when it holds none.
// Lengths are in centimetres, angles in degrees, colours (red, green, blue).
// `openm2 view tree NAME --season fall --variants 4 --screenshot x.png`
// draws a recipe; `--trees FILE` tries another book.
(
    default: "beech",
    names: [
        (word: "palmetto", recipe: "palmetto"),
        (word: "palm", recipe: "palm"),
